## Fonts

Kiln embeds JetBrains Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1) as patched by Nerd Fonts (MIT). Both
licences are in the files `JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt` and `NerdFonts-LICENSE` next to this one.

## Code

Kiln's PTY loop is adapted from alacritty_terminal (Apache-2.0, © the Alacritty authors).
GPUI's platform crates (gpui_macos, gpui_windows, gpui_linux, gpui_platform and the like) come
from the same repository as `gpui` below (github.com/zed-industries/zed) under the same
Apache-2.0 licence.

